Not a real PDF, deliberately — TODO_PRODUIT.md T5(c)'s own test-only OCR stub
(backend/src/modules/documents/received-invoices/ocr/fake-extractor.ts) answers ANY byte stream
carrying its exact marker, regardless of real PDF structure (it never parses PDF at all, only scans
raw bytes) — a genuinely malformed "PDF" already degrades harmlessly through structural extraction
(extraction.spec.ts's own coverage), which is exactly what lets this fixture exercise the OCR
fallback path without needing a real, valid PDF binary.

__INVOICERR_FAKE_OCR_MARKER__
